---
// The conversion landing page (/plan-your-trip/ and its FR/ES/DE editions),
// built for paid ads and organic traffic alike.
//
// Everything a visitor needs to decide is on one page, in this order:
//   1. a five-question planner that names the right tour and the price for
//      THEIR group, with the early-booking discount applied when it applies;
//   2. a no-risk next step — hold the dates free, or WhatsApp;
//   3. the guarantees that remove the usual fears about Algeria;
//   4. proof (rating, licence, real travellers) and an honest season note.
// A visitor about to leave is offered the early-booking discount in exchange
// for an email or WhatsApp number.
//
// Layout and logic live here; words live in COPY below. Prices come from
// tours.json and luxury.mjs, tour names/descriptions from each language's
// tours-xx.ts, every promise from BOOKING in config.ts — the same sources as
// the tour pages and /booking-terms/. Nothing here invents a price, a
// deadline or a scarcity claim.
